We recommend fetching the official license text from the GNU website when vendor-ing the code. Example links:
- GPLv3: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt
- GPLv2: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.txt

If you intend to vendor the upstream sources into this folder, copy the exact upstream COPYING file into this path as `COPYING` so that the license is packaged with the code.
